#: ../../../source/user_guide/hooks/odb_extraction_hook.rst:66
msgid "``hookkit`` Usage"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/user_guide/hooks/odb_extraction_hook.rst:68
msgid ""
"``hookkit`` is a utility library for writing and executing extraction "
"hooks. It provides a simple interface for defining extraction logic and "
"handling the input and output of the extraction process. The main "
"function in hookkit is :func:`~hookkit.run`, which takes an extraction "
"function and runs it with the appropriate arguments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/user_guide/hooks/odb_extraction_hook.rst:70
msgid ""
"``hookkit`` also provides field output: or field quantities (stress "
"tensors, displacement fields), use :func:`~hookkit.field()`."
msgstr ""

